  "details": "A minor accessibility issue at https://wiki.vrchat.com/ during a maintenance. Fails WCAG Success Criterion 3.1.1 for accessibility, because screen reader software may not be able to determine the correct pronunciation and voice for the text to be read aloud.\n\nActual original markup (line 2):\n\n```\n\n<html>\n\n```\n\nExpected markup:\n\n```\n\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n```\n\nSee: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Global_attributes/lang",
